    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bCorporate Judge: Ctrl+Alt-Get Even!\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This RPG Maker-crafted strategy game weaponizes your workplace trauma into cathartic combat. Experience the ultimate &quot;anti-hustle&quot; fantasy of toppling toxic CEOs and yeeting unreasonable deadlines into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/30b874eb34b882074f66c6449d93f039.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/30b874eb34b882074f66c6449d93f039.gif?t=1753263569\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200bWarning to Under-35 Wage Slaves:\u200b</strong>\u200b May cause accidental deployment of sass during performance reviews. Handle with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>GamePlay: Tower of Druaga +\u00a0Persona</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay blends <i>Tower of Druaga</i>'s tactical battles with <i>Persona</i>'s social mechanics, remixed with puzzle-solving (imagine rearranging Jira tickets), match-3 stress relief (combo those TPS reports!), and roguelike office politics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/91d358820bb38bfa271386311533751f.avif?t=1753263569\" width=720 height=405 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Story:\u00a0Rookie Programmer meets Mysterious Cat</i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Cyber-Tokyo's corporate dystopia, you play as \u200b<strong>\u200bTogawa Tsubasa\u200b</strong>\u200b - a rookie programmer who accidentally sold her soul to Blackstone Corp. By day, she's a code monkey surviving micromanagement hell. By night, her consciousness rebels in the \u200b<strong>\u200bMidnight World\u200b</strong>\u200b after meeting Vita, a glitch-spewing cat who turns corporate jargon into combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit fellow broken souls from accounting purgatory and HR hellscape. Weaponize their burnout as special abilities. Storm the C-suite labyrinth where your manager's &quot;culture-building exercises&quot; have literally summoned a KPI Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
