okie programmer who accidentally sold her soul to Blackstone Corp. By day, she's a code monkey surviving micromanagement hell. By night, her consciousness rebels in the \u200b<strong>\u200bMidnight World\u200b</strong>\u200b after meeting Vita, a glitch-spewing cat who turns corporate jargon into combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/ee6af5d07d88ed7c7c0f0f008ad76485.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit fellow broken souls from accounting purgatory and HR hellscape. Weaponize their burnout as special abilities. Storm the C-suite labyrinth where your manager's &quot;culture-building exercises&quot; have literally summoned a KPI Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/a5fe5dd27fab12fdb46206497e53b2ec.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.poster.avif?t=1753263569\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.webm?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/18d4be4d4b06261916eef3b2c1ff6658.mp4?t=1753263569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
